From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Andy Boxer <andyboxer@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 4 Jul 2026 13:47:59 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] bcm47xx: flush cache for BMIPS3300 DMA sync

BMIPS3300 requires the same post-DMA cache synchronization treatment as
the other noncoherent BMIPS CPUs handled by the common DMA code.

Signed-off-by: Andy Boxer <andyboxer@gmail.com>
---
--- a/arch/mips/mm/dma-noncoherent.c
+++ b/arch/mips/mm/dma-noncoherent.c
@@ -31,6 +31,7 @@ static inline bool cpu_needs_post_dma_fl
 	case CPU_R10000:
 	case CPU_R12000:
 	case CPU_BMIPS5000:
+	case CPU_BMIPS3300:
 	case CPU_LOONGSON2EF:
 	case CPU_XBURST:
 		return true;
